rcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2e9dcade/uploads/origins/d0d76005-6501-41eb-bdcb-256c2c912437?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2ca16cdecc1523cfab6c44037fad2353, https://si.imgix.net/2e9dcade/uploads/origins/d0d76005-6501-41eb-bdcb-256c2c912437?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b33acc5f545cf91ec31eb3604ce5186e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2e9dcade/uploads/origins/d0d76005-6501-41eb-bdcb-256c2c912437?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=06c0358b73f0ffce89cb933065b5e1a7 3x"}, "body": "Hello there!\n\nI'd like an original character design please!\n\nThe character is a robot lady character, who has a military aesthetic with mechanical elements that remind of a wasp or a hornet (I am heavily inspired by characters such as these: https://twitter.com/bowalia/status/1459191473102983170 |  https://www.deviantart.com/muhut/art/Hornet-Mina-866559892 ). In particular, I like the idea of her leg being able to transform into a stinger. Small details that show she's a robot entirely would be nice!\n\nI would like her to have a statuesque form - tall, with large breasts - and I would like her to have hair covering one eye. I am reminded of this character ( https://mato-seihei-no-slave.fandom.com/wiki/Manga?file=Volume_08.jpg ). \n\nHowever, I leave her specific details to you. Just a simple pose to show off her design would be appreciated!\n\nThank you kindly!", "nc": 136, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@yahm_ai/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1147, "client_id": 926354, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4aab6307/uploads/origins/6c9b3cc4-3917-4c8e-9be5-7baf159ad2f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fc26dec39349c4e998c2fee26d9d